{"pin":"BH00004","subcodes":[{"code":"BH00004","anchor":"","title":"Kitab-i-Badi'","first_line":"Thy letter, containing certain unsubstantiated accounts and false reports, was received by this servant. On the one hand, it opened the portals of joy… By God! The relationship between the Revelation of the Primal Point (the Bab) and this most wondrous, this most glorious Revelation is identical to that of the Revelation of John, son of Zechariah (John the Baptist), and the Spirit of God (Jesus)... It would be more acceptable in My sight for a person to harm one of My own sons or relatives rather than inflict injury upon any soul","first_line_orig":"مکتوبت که مشعر بر بعض روایات غیرمحققه و اخبارات غیرصادقه بود باین عبد فانی  ","language":"Per","word_count":"84700","notes":" LAC.175-210,  \u003ca href=\"https://d9263461.github.io/cl/Baha'i/Others/ROB/V2/Contents.html\"\u003eROB2.370 et al\u003c/a\u003e,  \u003ca href=\"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/BKOG.pdf#page=23\"\u003eBKOG.124\u003c/a\u003e,  \u003ca href=\"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/BKOG.pdf#page=23\"\u003eBKOG.245\u003c/a\u003e,  \u003ca href=\"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/BKOG.pdf#page=23\"\u003eBKOG.257\u003c/a\u003e,  \u003ca href=\"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/o/GS/gs-97.html\"\u003eGSH.097\u003c/a\u003e,  \u003ca href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20070930181707/http://bahai-library.com/resources/leiden.list/leiden.list.html#28\"\u003eLL#028\u003c/a\u003e","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15709.001","source":"BLIB_Or15709","locator":"001"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AKHA_137BE #06 p.081x","source":"AKHA_137BE #06 p.081x","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/akhbar-i-amri/"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ANDA#10 p.66x","source":"ANDA","locator":"10 p.66x","url":"https://www.afnanlibrary.org/d/andalib-issue-10"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ANDA#55 p.03x","source":"ANDA","locator":"55 p.03x","url":"https://www.afnanlibrary.org/d/